  "948": {
    "inputs": {
      "global_prompt": "mysterious  Jakarta at night, dramatic shadows and rim light,hyperrealistic, Asian cinematic noir style,inspired by Wong Kar-Wai and Blade Runner 2049, photographed with a Samyang AF 35mm f/1.4 RF lens, rich ambient mood,stylized color palette of crimson,cyan,and deep charcoal",
      "max_frames": 674,
      "timeline_data": "{\"segments\":[{\"prompt\":\"The woman, called Elsa, is walking down the street. Tracking camera. She talks with an asian-american accents, and she says: \\\"so this first segment should be 8 seconds. hopefully ...\\\" \\n\\nIts raining.\\n\\nAt the end, scene cut to a new scene. \",\"length\":204,\"color\":\"#4f8edc\"},{\"prompt\":\"A man called Tom, is waiting, leaning up against the wall. He talks with a rusty deep american accent, and he says:  \\\"and i wonder if i can raise 8... so I end at 16\\\". \\n\\nIts raining.\\n\\nAt the end, scene cut to a new scene. \",\"length\":192,\"color\":\"#e07b3a\"},{\"prompt\":\"Tom and Elsa have met up. The man says : \\\"are we at 16 now ? 8 plus 8 should be\\\".  \\n\\nThe woman says: \\\"you are right mister\\\". \\n\\nIts raining.\\n\\nAt the end, scene cut to a new scene. \",\"length\":156,\"color\":\"#5cb85c\"},{\"prompt\":\"Tom and Elsa are seated at a window at a dim lit bar. Elsa talks, and she says : \\\"did the math add up? are we at 23\\\" \\n\\nThe man nods his head, and he says : \\\"only time will tell.....\\\" \\n\\nThe camrea pulls out, and shows more of the scene...   and slowly fades out\",\"length\":121,\"color\":\"#d9534f\"}]}",
      "local_prompts": "The woman, called Elsa, is walking down the street. Tracking camera. She talks with an asian-american accents, and she says: \"so this first segment should be 8 seconds. hopefully ...\" \n\nIts raining.\n\nAt the end, scene cut to a new scene.  | A man called Tom, is waiting, leaning up against the wall. He talks with a rusty deep american accent, and he says:  \"and i wonder if i can raise 8... so I end at 16\". \n\nIts raining.\n\nAt the end, scene cut to a new scene.  | Tom and Elsa have met up. The man says : \"are we at 16 now ? 8 plus 8 should be\".  \n\nThe woman says: \"you are right mister\". \n\nIts raining.\n\nAt the end, scene cut to a new scene.  | Tom and Elsa are seated at a window at a dim lit bar. Elsa talks, and she says : \"did the math add up? are we at 23\" \n\nThe man nods his head, and he says : \"only time will tell.....\" \n\nThe camrea pulls out, and shows more of the scene...   and slowly fades out",
      "segment_lengths": "204, 192, 156, 121",
      "epsilon": 0.001,
